&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our mission to build the future of commerce is real. We push the boundaries of what’s possible to solve problems and break traditional tradeoffs. Join Coupang now to create an epic experience in this always-on, high-tech, and hyper-connected world.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Role Overview&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The TSE org is critical to Coupang’s business strategy. This role will&amp;nbsp;be responsible for&amp;nbsp;ownership &amp;amp; end-to-end company-wide charter, delivery &amp;amp; execution starting from Product &amp;amp; Service Definition, Functional Design, Engineering execution Lifecycle with a Customer focus and Customer lifecycle management for Coupang’s Platform. You will be part of a Global team working from&amp;nbsp;different locations&amp;nbsp;but still work as a central connected unit. This role will&amp;nbsp;possess&amp;nbsp;a strong blend of technical, business, and project management experience that enables effective management of tangible solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;As a&amp;nbsp;TSE TPM&amp;nbsp;Intern, you will work alongside experienced&amp;nbsp;TPMs&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;own and execute on programs,&amp;nbsp;working&amp;nbsp;closely with members of multiple business &amp;amp; Engineering teams to help define, streamline, design and&amp;nbsp;analyze&amp;nbsp;data to build business requirements and then work with engineering teams to articulate requirements, further perform functional &amp;amp; technical data &amp;amp; system analysis, drive engineering to implementation via all phases of Software Development Lifecycle (SDLC).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What You Will do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
